                    size: 64,
                    color: Colors.red.shade400,
                  ),
                  const SizedBox(height: 16),
                  Text(
                    'Failed to load children',
                    style: TextStyle(
                      fontSize: 18,
                      color: Colors.grey.shade600,
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.w500,
